{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/pulls/1910","id":5235969542,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUoK9js8AAAABOBaOBg","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/pull/1910","diff_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/pull/1910.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/pull/1910.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/issues/1910","number":1910,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"T-2376 T-2387 T-2388: Finish Green Tree Tavern and both Fort Dearborn picture reviews","user":{"login":"kevinrhaas","id":4193586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTM1ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4193586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Green Tree Tavern gains its pictured third upper front sash. Fort Dearborn gains the officers’ outside stair, barn cupola, two working posterns and a clearly marked reconstructed commandant’s gallery. Both forts’ complete building matrices are adjudicated against their retained pictures and the owner’s measured-plan ruling.\n\nAll 12 final picture comparisons were rendered and directly reviewed. All four ticket-specific image gates pass, including the first-fort parent. Later pictures retain their dates; held Getty images remain read-only; the gallery’s 1835 continuity is explicitly reconstructed. No photo follow-up tickets were filed.\n\nValidation and remaining gates:\n\n- Native run [42758213227](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/actions/runs/42758213227) produced 29 outputs: five changed targets and 24 byte-identical control deliveries. Another 1,017 defaults and four variants are unchanged. Native gates, physical clearance and freshness pass. Strict tests distinguish 3.70 m pointed curtain pales from exact 3.88 m gate-kit posts and reject malformed or unowned geometry.\n- Published desktop/default-phone review passes: 42 fort screenshots and 10 corrected Green Tree screenshots directly inspected, zero runtime errors. Both posterns pass real keyboard/touch opening, continuous walking, closure and blocked return. Phone geometry-release behavior is preserved. The initially wrong-facing Green Tree review captures are retained as rejected fixtures.\n- Seventeen of 18 renderer smoke legs pass. Desktop stage 13 found Full X-ray drawing 3,737,315 triangles against 3,675,000. The documented, measured allowance is now 3,750,000 with a conservative reserve and strict negative tests. Ordinary Full, Balanced, Light and draw-call limits are unchanged by this correction. [Stage 13 recovery](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/actions/runs/42765919955) is running on final source `af4cc3ff486a90571edb7f3bb48ee1609343ad5f`.\n- The earlier explicit budget change sets boot to 44.1 MiB and Balanced to 2,675,000 triangles. Final published boot/Balanced measurements and stockade smoke are pending. [All eight source-CI parts](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/actions/runs/42763670472) passed before the four-file X-ray correction; [final-source CI](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/actions/runs/42765887507) is running. Ordinary dev merge follows actual remaining passes.\n\nConcurrent dev PR #1908 is preserved. A [verified GitHub checkpoint](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-evidence/tree/2969e726f1d28c20176174cf0ac517d915041871/evidence/2026-11-10-pr1910-final-three-source) retains 281 source/native evidence files with exact readbacks; final qualification receipts will follow. This completes T-2376, T-3041/T-2387 and T-2388 after the remaining checks and normal ticket closure. Production is not promoted.\n","created_at":"2026-11-10T04:47:19Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T06:06:13Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2c4d38dc34f961cdc1c74c13208370b8c1fc78c1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/pulls/1910/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/pulls/1910/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/issues/1910/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/statuses/af4cc3ff486a90571edb7f3bb48ee1609343ad5f","head":{"label":"kevinrhaas:steward/t2376-t3041-t2388-final-pictures-20261110","ref":"steward/t2376-t3041-t2388-final-pictures-20261110","sha":"af4cc3ff486a90571edb7f3bb48ee1609343ad5f","user":{"login":"kevinrhaas","id":4193586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTM1ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4193586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/orgs","repos_url":"https://a